{
 "_doc": "Who runs in which job. cmd + [job, size, outdir] is the harness contract (README.md). jobs: what the contestant does; every other job is n/a, with the reason from na (keys: a job, or read/edit/create for a family). million: also runs the 1,000,000-row report in the million tier. league: engine (lays out pages itself from a table/report definition), writer (executes pre-laid-out draw ops) or read-edit (no create job); merge.py splits the create tables by it. os: windows marks a contestant that runs only on the windows-latest job (with ours, on the same machine; its tables are a separate source, never ranked against the Linux runs).",
